			"Message": "fix(Cocoon): Fix executeCommand field name and improve document state parsing\n\nChange the executeCommand request body field from `args` to `arguments` to match the expected Mountain backend interface. Also improve the $acceptModelAdded handler to properly parse DocumentStateDTO from Rust:\n- Use URI.toString() method when available for proper URI formatting\n- Handle content as either Lines array (Vec<String>) joined by EOL or direct string content\n- Simplify content length calculation in logging\n\nThese changes ensure proper gRPC communication with Mountain and correct document state synchronization.",
